│                          │ - Keep early_stopping_rounds for robust training.                                         │
│                          │ - Ensure dropna is done after shifting features.                                          │
│                          │ These changes should increase prediction variance (pred_std_ratio) and model expressivity │
│                          │ without overfitting, avoiding prediction collapse.                                        │
