│ patch_type               │ fix                                                                                       │
│ patch_name               │ fix_prediction_collapse_increase_expressivity_lower_reg_alpha                             │
│ patch_description        │ The validation error indicates the predictions collapse toward the mean, reflected by an  │
│                          │ extremely low pred_std_ratio (0.0091), which is much below the threshold 0.15. This means │
│                          │ the model is underfitting and not capturing signal, possibly due to too strong            │
│                          │ regularization and/or insufficient model expressivity.                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Root cause:                                                                               │
│                          │ - The current reg_alpha=0.1 imposes L1 regularization that may be too strong given the    │
│                          │ feature set, causing coefficients to shrink towards zero.                                 │
│                          │ - Model max_depth=4 and n_estimators=300 with low learning_rate=0.01 may be too           │
│                          │ conservative and slow to learn.                                                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Fix:                                                                                      │
│                          │ - Reduce reg_alpha from 0.1 to 0 to reduce L1 penalization.                               │
│                          │ - Slightly increase max_depth from 4 to 6 to allow more complex splits.                   │
│                          │ - Increase learning_rate to 0.03 to speed up convergence.                                 │
│                          │ - Keep early_stopping_rounds to prevent overfitting.                                      │
│                          │ These changes aim to increase model expressivity and reduce regularization to avoid       │
│                          │ collapsing predictions.                                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ No code logic errors in feature building were visible, so no changes made there.          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This fix addresses the "collapse toward mean" issue as recommended by the warning.        │
